">hollow </span><span begin="00:53.470" end="00:53.860">point </span><span begin="00:53.860" end="00:54.910">smile</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.840" end="00:57.850"><span begin="00:55.840" end="00:56.170">We </span><span begin="00:56.170" end="00:56.410">had </span><span begin="00:56.410" end="00:56.530">our </span><span begin="00:56.530" end="00:56.860">run </span><span begin="00:56.860" end="00:57.250">away </span><span begin="00:57.250" end="00:57.850">scarves'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.850" end="01:02.710"><span begin="00:57.850" end="00:58.150">Got </span><span begin="00:58.150" end="00:58.210">a </span><span begin="00:58.210" end="00:59.110">photograph </span><span begin="00:59.110" end="00:59.650">dream </span><span begin="00:59.650" end="00:59.860">on </span><span begin="00:59.860" end="00:59.950">the </span><span begin="00:59.950" end="01:00.730">getaway </span><span begin="01:00.730" end="01:01.600">mile</span><span begin="01:01.600" end="01:02.710">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.710" end="01:05.230"><span begin="01:02.710" end="01:03.010">Let's </span><span begin="01:03.010" end="01:03.300">blow </span><span begin="01:03.300" end="01:03.390">a </span><span begin="01:03.390" end="01:03.730">hole </span><span begin="01:03.730" end="01:03.880">in </span><span begin="01:03.880" end="01:04.270">this </span><span begin="01:04.270" end="01:05.230">town</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.250" end="01:09.850"><span begin="01:06.250" end="01:06.430">And </span><span begin="01:06.430" end="01:06.700">do </span><span begin="01:06.700" end="01:06.820">our </span><span begin="01:06.820" end="01:07.330">talking </span><span begin="01:07.330" end="01:07.570">with </span><span begin="01:07.570" end="01:07.660">the </span><span begin="01:07.660" end="01:08.590">laser </span><span begin="01:08.590" end="01:09.430">thing</span><span begin="01:09.430" end="01:09.850">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.850" end="01:11.770"><